{
  "tema": 7075,
  "slug": "algo-de",
  "titulo": "Algo de + noun = some, a bit of",
  "subtitulo": "¿Tienes algo de dinero? Siento algo de miedo.",
  "foto": "t10.jpg",
  "regla": "Algo de + singular (often uncountable or abstract) noun = some, a bit of: algo de dinero, algo de miedo. It never changes. For plural nouns, use algunos / algunas. Un poco de is the most common alternative.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "algo de",
            "+ singular noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "_Some, a bit of_. Mostly with **uncountable** or **abstract** nouns: **dinero, tiempo, miedo, comida, razón**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Algo de** never changes and doesn't go with plural nouns. For plurals: **algunos / algunas**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Un poco de** means the same and is more common."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Also: **algo de** + infinitive (**¿hay algo de comer?**) and **tener algo de** + adjective (**tiene algo de raro**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **algo de** = a scoop of something you can't count."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Déjame ==algo de== carne para la noche.",
              "en": "Leave me some meat for tonight."
            },
            {
              "es": "Todavía siento ==algo de== rencor por lo que me hizo.",
              "en": "I still feel some resentment for what he did to me."
            },
            {
              "es": "Si te queda ==algo de== sentido común, no salgas con ella.",
              "en": "If you have any common sense left, don't go out with her."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Tienes ==algo de== dinero?",
              "en": "Do you have any money?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Mamá, ¿hay ==algo de== comer?",
              "en": "Mom, is there anything to eat?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Este asunto tiene ==algo de== raro.",
              "en": "There's something odd about this."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
